Output demos/ramona-voice.gif
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1000
Set Height 360
Set Padding 16
Set TypingSpeed 90ms
Set CursorBlink false

Type "cd /tmp/ramona-smoke"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms

Type "pi -p 'who are you?' 'admit it, you are just autocomplete with lipstick'"
Enter
Sleep 28s
